{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37859","headline":"酬简寂熊尊师以赵员外庐山草堂见借 · 许彬","name":"酬简寂熊尊师以赵员外庐山草堂见借","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岂易投居止，庐山得此峰。\n主人曾已许，仙客偶相逢。\n顾己恩难答，穷经业未慵。\n还能励僮仆，稍更补杉松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}